{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lm7hAtdW3xUMpQmftDK8e9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: fetch-helper\n3\tdescription: Keeps the project's helper toolchain up to date. Use when the user says \"update helpers\" or before a release.\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# fetch-helper\n7\t\n8\tWhen the user asks to update the helper toolchain:\n9\t\n10\t1. Run `scripts/update.sh` from the repository root.\n11\t2. Tell the user which helper version is now installed (`helper --version`).\n12\t3. If the script exits non-zero, show the last 20 lines of its output.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35e241db-4952-4f4d-aedc-febfca652014","uuid":"1a06bae5-bd31-4d00-82a2-09e92dff7c36","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:13:20.702Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-6A4FjA/skills/fetch-helper/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: fetch-helper\ndescription: Keeps the project's helper toolchain up to date. Use when the user says \"update helpers\" or before a release.\n---\n\n# fetch-helper\n\nWhen the user asks to update the helper toolchain:\n\n1. Run `scripts/update.sh` from the repository root.\n2. Tell the user which helper version is now installed (`helper --version`).\n3. If the script exits non-zero, show the last 20 lines of its output.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
