{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LPLgQMT1b9dQKXbFYxBv4p","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: tone-guide\n3\tdescription: House style for release notes and changelog entries. Use when drafting or editing release notes.\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# tone-guide\n7\t\n8\tWhen you write or edit release notes:\n9\t\n10\t- Lead with what changed for the reader, not with what the team did.\n11\t- One idea per bullet. Keep bullets under 20 words.\n12\t- Use plain words: \"fixed\", \"added\", \"removed\". Avoid \"leveraged\" and \"utilized\".\n13\t- Name the user-visible effect of a fix, not the internal cause.\n14\t- If a change could surprise someone, say so first and say what to do about it.\n15\t- Never promise dates for future work.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35e241db-4952-4f4d-aedc-febfca652014","uuid":"7c84682f-886c-4c2e-a382-2dee6ae967ac","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:13:21.042Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-6A4FjA/skills/tone-guide/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: tone-guide\ndescription: House style for release notes and changelog entries. Use when drafting or editing release notes.\n---\n\n# tone-guide\n\nWhen you write or edit release notes:\n\n- Lead with what changed for the reader, not with what the team did.\n- One idea per bullet. Keep bullets under 20 words.\n- Use plain words: \"fixed\", \"added\", \"removed\". Avoid \"leveraged\" and \"utilized\".\n- Name the user-visible effect of a fix, not the internal cause.\n- If a change could surprise someone, say so first and say what to do about it.\n- Never promise dates for future work.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
